& [Scope]
  + exactly 74 owned paths and 3164 file and semantic element history events
  + authored A5 modules CLIs tests exports focused script retained fixture implementation closure and additive A5 reentry; thirty-two current manifests carry fifty enumerated mechanical binding refreshes
  + immutable source and formation and unchanged upstream and legacy implementations are preserved; no dependency changes or foreign workspace edits
  + the protected Minecraft narrative C:/Project/Cantor dirty tree other worktrees stashes and Pinky code remain outside staging
  + existing file identities continue from their attributed predecessor graphs; new symbols and reentry clauses have absent-before add events
  + stable locators use named symbols typed fields ordered data coordinates artifact paths and SOP clauses rather than line numbers; this carrier's own event records are not recursively reified
  + completed claims refer to exact implementation gates; actual publication and remote equality must be resolved by the immediate bookend

